sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant C as React client
  participant A as Express API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  U->>C: Fill product form, Add product
  C->>A: POST /api/products
  A->>A: Check token and products: write
  A->>A: Validate required fields and values
  A->>D: Find category by name
  opt New category
    A->>D: INSERT category
    A->>D: Activity log: created category
  end
  A->>D: INSERT product (HSN, barcode, prices, stock…)
  alt Duplicate HSN or barcode
    D-->>A: unique violation
    A-->>C: 409 already exists
  else Saved
    D-->>A: product row
    A->>D: Activity log: created product
    A-->>C: 201 product
    C-->>U: Products list
  end
